WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.223
Bird flew around the aquarium.

2
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:26.624
"Look at all these fish!" she said.

3
00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:35.239
"I wish Kip was here."

4
00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.437
Kip walked around the aquarium.

5
00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:46.845
"Look at all these fish!" he said.

6
00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:54.286
"I wish Bird was here."

7
00:00:54.287 --> 00:01:07.596
Bird saw an octopus.

8
00:01:07.597 --> 00:01:22.649
She touched a huge stingray.

9
00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:27.971
She fed some sea turtles.

10
00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:35.067
Kip spotted a shark.

11
00:01:35.068 --> 00:01:38.454
It looked scary and mean.

12
00:01:38.455 --> 00:01:43.233
And it had lots of sharp teeth!

13
00:01:43.234 --> 00:01:46.492
"Ah!" cried Kip.

14
00:01:46.493 --> 00:01:50.601
Kip ran away from the shark.

15
00:01:50.602 --> 00:01:53.891
He ran as fast as he could.

16
00:01:53.892 --> 00:01:55.276
Crash!

17
00:01:55.277 --> 00:02:04.791
"Squawk!" cried Bird.

18
00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:08.773
"Sorry about that," said Kip.

19
00:02:08.774 --> 00:02:11.961
Then Bird and Kip looked at each other.

20
00:02:11.962 --> 00:02:15.451
"You're here!" they both said.

21
00:02:15.452 --> 00:02:17.915
The two friends laughed.

22
00:02:17.916 --> 00:02:21.309
"I'm glad you're here, Bird," said Kip.

23
00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:24.523
"The aquarium will be more fun with you."

24
00:02:24.524 --> 00:02:28.776
"And I'm glad you're here, Kip," said Bird.

25
00:02:28.777 --> 00:02:36.339
"Everything is more fun with you!"
